{
  "title": { "zh": "每个目标都做一遍" },
  "adds": ["each"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "元件只处理第一个目标，几个目标要做同样的事时，同样的元件得接几遍。新元件<part-ref to=\"part:each\"></part-ref>：框里的元件对每个目标各做一遍，每次只看那一个目标。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "s-each",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "budget": 4,
      "tests": [{ "goal": "(Rain → Rain) ∧ (Wind → Wind)" }, { "goal": "(Wet ∧ Rain → Wet ∧ Rain) ∧ (Slip → Slip)" }],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手，最多用 4 个元件，证完每一个目标。"
      },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "拼成以后的两个目标，要做的是同一件事。" }],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = andI()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = each(c0, body: c3) {",
        "  body {",
        "    c2r0 = impI()",
        "    c2 = rule(c1.body, c2r0)",
        "    c3 = assumption(c2)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- c1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
